{"id":"07afadb094119590","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-substitution-lemma.md","title":"Substitution Lemma","display":"lem-substitution-lemma — Substitution Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-substitution-lemma","aliases":["92-lem-substitution-lemma"],"display":"lem-substitution-lemma — Substitution Lemma","depends_on":["[[92-df-substitution-function]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-substitution]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-fact-sub-recursive]]"],"source":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义","source_status":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-substitution-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-substitution-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-substitution-lemma — Substitution Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"067a36526639087d\" href=\"?note=067a36526639087d\" title=\"92-df-substitution-function\">92-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5d8c59019598b33c\" href=\"?note=5d8c59019598b33c\" title=\"92-fact-sub-recursive\">92-fact-sub-recursive</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (formula and distinguished variable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(n \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (number)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}\\)</span> (substitution function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"067a36526639087d\" href=\"?note=067a36526639087d\" title=\"92-df-substitution-function\">92-df-substitution-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (capture-avoiding syntactic substitution, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}lemma} \\vdash\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0)\\urcorner\n=\\mathrm{Sub}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}lemma} \\vdash\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0)\\urcorner\n=\\mathrm{Sub}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>左端明确使用无捕获操作<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0)\\)</span>，不再把<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\bar n)\">\\(\\varphi(\\bar n)\\)</span>当作未经定义的函数应用</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}(m, n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}(m, n)\\)</span> : 代入函数</li>\n<li>关键：闭实例<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0)\\)</span>的Gödel数由<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>通过递归函数计算</li>\n<li>这是算术化的核心</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5d8c59019598b33c\" href=\"?note=5d8c59019598b33c\" title=\"92-fact-sub-recursive\">92-fact-sub-recursive</a>给出码层运算的全递归延拓；要断言该运算可在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>内表示，还须调用递归函数表示定理</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"067a36526639087d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"725c1f1651ce9a00","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-fact-sub-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"5d8c59019598b33c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-fact-sub-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"067a36526639087d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sub}$ (substitution function, see [[92-df-substitution-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"725c1f1651ce9a00","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Subst}_G$ (capture-avoiding syntactic substitution, see [[92-df-substitution]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-fact-sub-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"5d8c59019598b33c","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[92-fact-sub-recursive]]给出码层运算的全递归延拓；要断言该运算可在$G$内表示，还须调用递归函数表示定理","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"n \\in \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subst}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}lemma} \\vdash\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0)\\urcorner\n=\\mathrm{Sub}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(\\bar n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}(m, n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1672,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-251","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-lem-substitution-lemma]]"}],"outgoing":["067a36526639087d","b78092e29a02d697","2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","5a1bd470754681a7","725c1f1651ce9a00","d666a3e3ee6c8148","5d8c59019598b33c"]}